vital)</li>\\r\\n<li>Une communication op&eacute;rationnelle centralis&eacute;e</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</div>\",\"items\":[],\"after\":\"\"}',4,'2026-08-22 17:48:01',1,0,0,1),
