veau code.\"},\"auth.error.locked\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component after too many invalid code attempts.\",\"text\":\"Trop d’essais. Demandez un nouveau code.\"},\"auth.error.missing_code\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when no verification code was provided.\",\"text\":\"Veuillez saisir le code reçu par e-mail.\"},\"auth.error.missing_password\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the password field is empty in password login mode.\",\"text\":\"Veuillez saisir votre mot de passe.\"},\"auth.error.request_failed\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the AJAX request to start login fails.\",\"text\":\"Impossible d\'envoyer la demande.\"},\"auth.error.reset_send_failed\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the password reset email could not be sent.\",\"text\":\"Impossible d\'envoyer l\'e-mail de réinitialisation.\"},\"auth.error.restart_login\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the anti-spam flow must be restarted.\",\"text\":\"Merci de relancer la connexion.\"},\"auth.error.send_failed\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the server cannot send the email code.\",\"text\":\"Impossible d\'envoyer le code par e-mail.\"},\"auth.error.unexpected\":{\"context\":\"Generic error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component for unexpected responses.\",\"text\":\"Une erreur est survenue.\"},\"auth.error.verify_failed\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the AJAX request to verify the code fails.\",\"text\":\"Impossible de vérifier le code.\"},\"auth.error.wrong_answer\":{\"context\":\"Error shown in the shared authentication JavaScript component when the anti-spam challenge answer is wrong.\",\"text\